<title>USA: NetBank says completes IPO of 3.5 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>NetBank says completes IPO of 3.5 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>NetBank Inc said Tuesday it completed an initial public offering of 3.5 million shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The public offering of $42 million was underwritten by Morgan Keegan &amp; Co and Interstate/Johnson Lane Corp.</p>
<p>NetBank operates Altanta Internet Bank.</p>
